*.tsbuildinfo

example

# generated native folders
/ios
/android

# R108: the companion's stable signing key is COMMITTED on purpose (a
# self-signed sideload key in a private repo — see android-signing/README.md
# for the rationale + the rotation procedure). Negate the generic rule above.
!android-signing/*.p12
